[? if unsc_won = 1 : After three rounds of voting, Spain defeats Turkey and wins a seat on the Security Council for 2015 and 2016, the fifth in its history. For two years Spanish diplomats will sit at the table on Syria, Libya and North Korea. ?][? if unsc_won = 0 : Spain falls short in the third round. The seat goes to Turkey, and the opposition and government blame each other. ?]

