= Brexit

The United Kingdom votes to leave the European Union. Three hundred thousand Spaniards live there, and as many Britons live in Spain. Gibraltar voted 96% to remain; the foreign ministry is already talking about co-sovereignty.

- @brexit_eu: Stand with the EU: no special deals, the Union negotiates as one
- @brexit_gibraltar: Put Gibraltar on the table
- @brexit_people: Make it about people: protect citizens on both sides

@brexit_eu
on-arrival: {! if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.intl(Q, 'eu', 6); window.SpainGame.target(Q, 'psoe', 'middle', 1); } !}

Brussels appreciates a reliable partner.

