= Las Ramblas

A van drives into the crowds on Barcelona's Ramblas; another attack follows in Cambrils. Sixteen people are killed. The attackers were young men from Ripoll, radicalised by an imam. For a few days, Spain and Catalonia mourn together, a month before the referendum.

- @attack_unity: Stand with every government, Spanish and Catalan
- @attack_police: Question the coordination between the Mossos and the national police
- @attack_islamophobia: Warn against blaming Muslims and migrants

@attack_unity
on-arrival: {! Q.sanchez_authority += 3; Q.rel_pp += 2; Q.rel_erc += 3; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.target(Q, 'psoe', 'pensioners', 1); } !}

Your presence at the march in Barcelona is noted with respect.

@attack_police
