= La Manada

A court in Navarre convicts five men of "sexual abuse" rather than rape for the group assault of an 18-year-old during the San Fermín festival, because she did not resist. Hundreds of thousands of women take to the streets: "It's not abuse, it's rape."

- @only_yes: Promise a law where only yes means yes
- @review_code: Call for a review of the penal code by experts
- @respect_courts: Respect the courts' decision

@only_yes
on-arrival: {! Q.progressives_dissent -= 5; Q.only_yes_law = 1; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.target(Q, 'psoe', 'women', 3); window.SpainGame.position(Q, 0, 1.5); } !}

The feminist movement has its demand, and the PSOE has made it its own. Drafting such a law well will be harder than promising it.

@review_code
on-arrival: {! Q.institutionalists_dissent -= 3; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.target(Q, 'psoe', 'women', 1.5); } !}

Serious and slow. The marchers wanted more.

