= The master's degree

Madrid's president, Cristina Cifuentes, turns out to have been awarded a master's degree she never studied for, with forged marks. Then a video emerges of her being stopped for shoplifting face cream years before. She resigns.

- @madrid_censure: Table a motion of no confidence in the Madrid assembly
- @demand_elections: Demand early elections in Madrid
- @universities: Make it about cleaning up the universities

