In the Airbus dispute, Washington slaps 25% tariffs on Spanish olive oil, olives, wine and cheese. [? if tariff_hit = 2 : With relations already cold, Spain is hit harder than its neighbours. ?] Farmers in Andalusia and Castilla-La Mancha face ruin, and blame the government.

- @tariffs_eu: Answer through the EU: retaliation on American goods
- @tariffs_bilateral: Negotiate directly with Washington
- @tariffs_farmers: Compensate the farmers

