= The recovery fund

For the first time, the EU will borrow together: €750 billion for recovery, much of it in grants. The "frugal" northern countries want loans with conditions; Spain, Italy, Portugal and Greece want grants. [? if recovery_size = 2 : With strong allies in Brussels and the south, Spain secures around €140 billion, nearly half of it in grants. ?][? if recovery_size = 1 : Spain secures a fair share, after hard bargaining. ?][? if recovery_size = 0 : With few friends in Brussels, Spain gets less than it hoped, and on stricter terms. ?]

- @fund_green: Spend it on the green and digital transition
- @fund_regions: Share it generously with the regions
- @fund_social: Put it into health, care and jobs

@fund_green
on-arrival: {! if (Q.psoe_in_government) { Q.fiscal_adj -= 0.3 * Q.recovery_size; } if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.intl(Q, 'eu', 4); window.SpainGame.target(Q, 'psoe', 'young', 1 + Q.recovery_size); } !}

