max-visits: 1
on-arrival: la_palma_seen = 1

= The volcano

A volcano erupts on La Palma. For three months lava buries homes, farms and banana plantations; seven thousand people are evacuated.

- @palma_aid: [? if psoe_in_government = 1 : Declare a disaster zone and fund the reconstruction ?][? if psoe_in_government = 0 : Demand that the government spends whatever it takes ?]
- @palma_visit: Visit, listen, and promise not to forget

@palma_aid
on-arrival: {! if (Q.psoe_in_government) { Q.fiscal_adj += 0.05; } Q.rel_cc += 5; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.regionalMod(Q, 'Canarias', 'psoe', 1.03); } !}

The islanders remember who came, and who paid.

@palma_visit
on-arrival: rel_cc += 2

The visit is appreciated; the help will be measured later.

@ukraine
