= War in Ukraine

Russia invades Ukraine. Millions flee west; gas and electricity prices explode. [? if psoe_in_government = 1 : Your coalition partners in Podemos oppose sending weapons. ?]

- @ukraine_arms: Send weapons with the EU and NATO
- @ukraine_humanitarian: Humanitarian aid and refugees, no weapons
- @ukraine_refugees: Open Spain to Ukrainian refugees, whatever else

@ukraine_arms
on-arrival: {! Q.rel_up -= 10; Q.progressives_dissent += 5; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.intl(Q, 'nato', 12); window.SpainGame.intl(Q, 'eu', 6); window.SpainGame.intl(Q, 'us', 8); window.SpainGame.target(Q, 'psoe', 'middle', 1); window.SpainGame.partyRel(Q, 'pp', 'up', -5); } !}

Spain stands with its allies. Podemos votes against in Congress, and the coalition creaks.

@ukraine_humanitarian
on-arrival: {! Q.rel_up += 4; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.intl(Q, 'nato', -8); window.SpainGame.intl(Q, 'eu', -4); window.SpainGame.intl(Q, 'us', -6); } !}

Brussels and Washington notice who is missing from the list.

@ukraine_refugees
on-arrival: {! if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.intl(Q, 'eu', 4); window.SpainGame.intl(Q, 'un', 4); window.SpainGame.target(Q, 'psoe', 'women', 1); } !}

Families in Málaga and Valencia take in Ukrainians. For once, almost nobody objects.

@sahara
title: The letter to Rabat
new-page: true
tags: sp_event
view-if: sahara_seen = 0 and psoe_in_government = 1 and ceuta_seen = 1 and ((year = 2022 and month >= 3) or year >= 2023)
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: sahara_seen = 1

= The letter to Rabat

Morocco offers to end the crisis if Spain backs its plan for autonomy for Western Sahara under Moroccan sovereignty, abandoning Spain's long neutrality. Algeria, which supplies much of Spain's gas and backs the Polisario, warns of consequences.

- @sahara_morocco: Back Morocco's autonomy plan
- @sahara_neutral: Keep Spain's neutrality

@sahara_morocco
on-arrival: {! Q.rel_up -= 10; Q.progressives_dissent += 8; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.intl(Q, 'maghreb', 10); window.SpainGame.intl(Q, 'un', -5); } Q.fiscal_adj += 0.1; !}

Rabat reopens the borders and cooperates on migration. Algeria freezes its friendship treaty and raises gas prices. Every party in Congress, including your partners, votes to condemn the decision.

@sahara_neutral
on-arrival: {! if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.intl(Q, 'maghreb', -6); window.SpainGame.intl(Q, 'un', 3); } !}

Rabat keeps the pressure on, and the migration routes stay open.

@pegasus
title: Pegasus
