= Pegasus

Researchers reveal that the phones of dozens of Catalan independence leaders were infected with Pegasus spyware, and later that the Prime Minister's own phone was hacked too, probably from Morocco. ERC suspends its support until there are answers.

- @pegasus_dismiss: Dismiss the head of the intelligence service
- @pegasus_defend: Defend the services: everything was authorised by a judge

@pegasus_dismiss
on-arrival: {! Q.rel_erc += 12; Q.institutionalists_dissent += 6; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.intl(Q, 'nato', -2); } !}

ERC returns to the table. The intelligence community is furious.

@pegasus_defend
on-arrival: {! Q.rel_erc -= 8; Q.institutionalists_dissent -= 3; if (Q.depends_on_catalans && Q.rel_erc < 30) { Q.depends_on_catalans = 0; Q.lost_majority = 1; } !}

The services are reassured. ERC is not.

