= The Madrid summit

[? if nato_hosts = 1 : NATO's leaders meet in Madrid, forty years after Spain joined, to adopt a new strategy after the invasion of Ukraine, including, at Spain's insistence, the threats from the alliance's southern flank. Biden, at a dinner in the Prado, calls Spain a model ally. ?][? if nato_hosts = 0 : The alliance chooses another capital for its summit; Spain's allies have doubts about its commitment. ?]

@eu_presidency
title: The EU presidency
new-page: true
tags: sp_event
view-if: eu_presidency_seen = 0 and ((year = 2023 and month >= 7) or year >= 2024)
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: {! Q.eu_presidency_seen = 1; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.intl(Q, 'eu', 4); } if (Q.psoe_in_government) { Q.sanchez_authority += 3; } !}

= The EU presidency

For six months Spain holds the presidency of the Council of the European Union, chairing the negotiations on migration, artificial intelligence and fiscal rules. [? if psoe_in_government = 1 : You chair the summits, and the photographs help at home. ?][? if psoe_in_government = 0 : The government chairs the summits; the PSOE watches. ?]
